Section 131 of the Act is amended, in subsection (3) - (a} in paragraph (a}, by deleting "Clerk of Council" from the first line and by substituting "Permanent Secretary" therefor; (bj in paragraph (bj, by deleting "His Majesty the Sultan and Yang in Council" from the first line and by substituting "The Minister" (cj in paragraph (cj(i) in sub-paragraph (i), by deleting "His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan in Council" from the first two lines and by substituting "The Minister" therefor;

(ii) in sub-paragraph (ii) -

(A) by deleting "His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan in the first two lines and by substituting "The Minister" therefor;

(B) by deleting "His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan in the last third and fourth lines and by "the Minister" therefor; (dj in paragraph (ej, by deleting "His Majesty the Sultan and Yang in Council" from the first two lines and by substituting "the Minister"
